---
// Real FPT 2025 Note 25 EPS calculation: Bonus & Welfare Fund deduction reduces statutory EPS (and 2024 restated for bonus shares).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 275;
---
<figure class="sbp7-eps">
  <div class="sbp7-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="FPT 2025 audited Note 25 EPS calculation: 9,376.1B net profit attributable to shareholders minus 510.2B Bonus and Welfare Fund leaves 8,866.0B divided by 1,699.74M weighted shares = 5,216 VND Basic EPS, versus 5,516 VND before the deduction.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp7-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>FPT 2025 Audited Note 25: how Quỹ KTPL reduces EPS from 5,516 đ to 5,216 đ</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thuyết minh 25 BCTC FPT 2025: Quỹ KTPL kéo EPS từ 5.516 đ xuống 5.216 đ</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Box 1 */}
      <rect x="20" y="56" width="265" height="194" rx="10" class="sbp7-card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={48} y={84} size={22} />
      <text x="72" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>FPT Code 61 Profit (2025)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi CĐ Công ty mẹ (2025)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="36" y="124" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Parent PAT: 9,376.13B VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Lãi CĐ mẹ (61): 9.376,13 tỷ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="36" y="152" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Weighted avg: 1,699.74M sh</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• CP lưu hành BQ: 1.699,74 tr</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="36" y="216" class="sbp7-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Naive: 9,376B ÷ 1,700M = 5,516 đ</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chia thô: 9.376 ÷ 1.700 = 5.516 đ</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Arrow 1 */}
      <line x1="292" y1="150" x2="314" y2="150" class="sbp7-line" />
      <polygon points="314,145 322,150 314,155" class="sbp7-arrow" />

      {/* Box 2 */}
      <rect x="326" y="56" width="248" height="194" rx="10" class="sbp7-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={354} y={84} size={22} />
      <text x="378" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>VAS Note 25 Cut</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trừ Quỹ KTPL (Note 25)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="342" y="124" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Bonus &amp; Welfare appropriation</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trích Quỹ khen thưởng phúc lợi</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="342" y="154" class="sbp7-body sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>−510.17B VND (5.4% of PAT)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>−510,17 tỷ (năm 2024 trừ 625 tỷ!)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="342" y="196" class="sbp7-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Adjusted numerator: 8,865.96B</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tử số EPS chuẩn: 8.865,96 tỷ</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Arrow 2 */}
      <line x1="581" y1="150" x2="603" y2="150" class="sbp7-line" />
      <polygon points="603,145 611,150 603,155" class="sbp7-arrow" />

      {/* Box 3 */}
      <rect x="615" y="56" width="265" height="194" rx="10" class="sbp7-card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={643} y={84} size={22} />
      <text x="667" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Audited EPS (Code 70)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>EPS Kiểm toán (Mã 70)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="631" y="124" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• 8,865.96B ÷ 1,699.74M = 5,216 đ</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• 8.865,96 ÷ 1.699,74 = 5.216 đ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="631" y="154" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• 2024 restated: 4,944 → 4,292 đ</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• 2024 điều chỉnh: 4.944 → 4.292 đ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="631" y="196" class="sbp7-sub sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>SOEs deducting 20% shift P/E +25%!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>DN trích 20% sẽ đẩy P/E thật +25%!</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>FPT's audited Note 25 shows both Vietnamese EPS rules in one table: (1) deducting 510.17B VND for Bonus and Welfare drops 2025 EPS from 5,516 to 5,216 VND, and (2) issuing 222.18M bonus shares (15%) retroactively reduced 2024 EPS from 4,944 to 4,292 VND.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Thuyết minh 25 của FPT minh họa cả hai nguyên tắc tính EPS tại Việt Nam: (1) trừ 510,17 tỷ Quỹ KTPL kéo EPS 2025 từ 5.516 về 5.216 đồng, và (2) chia thêm 222,18 triệu CP thưởng 15% buộc điều chỉnh lùi EPS 2024 từ 4.944 xuống 4.292 đồng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp7-eps { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp7-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp7-eps svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp7-eps text { font-size: 12.2px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp7-title { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .sbp7-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp7-hdr { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp7-body { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp7-sub { font-size: 11.8px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-line { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp7-arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp7-eps figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
